TI  - Very early treadmill exercise facilitates neuroprotection and functional recovery following cerebral ischemia in rats
PY  - 2027
T2  - Behavioural Brain Research
VL  - 516
C7  - 116469
DO  - 10.1016/j.bbr.2026.116469
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/105050182459?origin=resultslist
